            <ArticleTitle>Facilitated recognition of an undeployed stent with StentBoost.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>397-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Underdeployment of stents is a major cause of restenosis. Standard cinegraphic visualisation has its shortcomings. We present a case in which we used a new technique, called StentBoost. This new technique enabled us to diagnose an undeployed stent as cause of a proximal restenosis problem, with direct major therapeutic consequences.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
